# PixelBot Architecture Context

Use this map first before scanning the repo again.

- App type: Next.js App Router support chatbot for retro handheld store workflows.
- Main user flow UI: `app/page.tsx` (chat, starter prompts, admin session config).
- Chat endpoint: `app/api/chat/route.ts` (streaming response + deterministic guardrails).
- Shared styling: `app/globals.css`.
- Retrieval/logic core:
  - `src/lib/knowledge-base.ts` (Q&A corpus)
  - `src/lib/retrieval.ts` (keyword/token overlap ranking)
  - `src/lib/handoff.ts` (recommendation clarifiers, out-of-scope checks, repair escalation phrase)
- Telemetry bootstrap: `instrumentation.ts` with Phoenix/OpenInference tracing.
- Runtime defaults and setup details: `README.md`.

When answering code questions:
1) Start from this map and open only the most likely files.
2) Prefer targeted symbol/path reads over broad repo-wide searches.
3) Treat guardrail behavior in API + handoff modules as source of truth.
